        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>HAZAR-ADDAR</strong> village of Addar, a place in the southern boundary of Palestine (Numbers 34:4), in the desert to the west of Kadesh-barnea. It is called Adar in Joshua 15:3.",
